\newlabel{fig:sidms_heatmaps}{{5}{8}{SI-DMS accuracy by delay and intervention count after Clean and Intervention training (five-seed means; shared scale, 40\%--100\%). Each event targets ten of 64 neurons; $K=0$ is unforced. The 2500-ms delay and $K=16,32,40$ are unseen during intervention training}{figure.5}{}}
